<hanmun_text>
<canon id="論語-陽貨-17-01">○子曰。巧言令色。鮮矣仁。</canon>
<commentary commentator="朱熹" id="論語-陽貨-17-01-C01">重<annotation type="sound">平聲</annotation>出。</commentary>
</hanmun_text>
</text_unit>
